# ArchForge environment
#
# The application env lives in apps/backend/.env (the backend is the only package
# that reads it). Copy apps/backend/.env.example to apps/backend/.env and fill it in:
#
#   AI_PROVIDER=azure|openai   (then the matching block for that provider)
#   PORT=3001
#
# See apps/backend/.env.example for the source of truth.
